cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or framework, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "XAD: Explainable Anomaly Detection Framework"
abstract: >-
  A modular framework for explainable time-series anomaly detection that
  combines autoencoder-based detection, temporal-aware conformal prediction
  for distribution-free confidence, multi-factor uncertainty decomposition,
  and counterfactual explanation (GA-CE, DICE, PerCE).
type: software
